cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SWLP in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SWLP: Sliding Window Layer Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Memory-efficient FP16 LLM inference on consumer hardware via
  layer streaming. Runs models larger than available RAM by
  streaming transformer layers SSD-to-RAM through a sliding
  window, with zero quantization of weights.
type: software
